{
  "_doc": "The travel library (v47 pilot on Crow Hollow; every map from v48, each with its own scenery from v49): each asset is one SVG here with a <g id=\"body\">, drawn at 100 canvas units a metre. The build imports them with svgart.py like the skull and launcher. foot: the point that stands on the ground. layer: which depth band it belongs to (docs/TRAVEL.md). family: which of the map's interactions it answers to (maps/01-hollow.json sheet.interactions). collision is always none: travel scenery is looks only; nothing in it ever touches a throw. lights: points that glow (x, y, radius in canvas units).",
